        "speaker": "RUFUS",
        "text": "Fair. What it means in practice is that enough investors decided the previous day's gain wasn't supported by new evidence of actual value — earnings, products, contracts — and started selling. Yesterday's price move was the belief. Today's reversal was the doubt. That's what AP is describing.",
